html","id":"ggaBdWMbS-g_text","label":"ggaBdWMbS-g_text","default":"<p>The cellular fuel that helps skin rebuild firmness and bounce.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gglsR2Q2Efy_text","label":"gglsR2Q2Efy_text","default":"<p>EGF</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg7sjJtMFK2_text","label":"gg7sjJtMFK2_text","default":"<p>The carrier protein that shrinks NAD so it finally absorbs.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggKMMyzIp_E_text","label":"ggKMMyzIp_E_text","default":"<p>Low-Molecular Collagen</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCxYF-MXLD_text","label":"ggCxYF-MXLD_text","default":"<p>Small enough to reach deeper and plump from within.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gggcXDF4391_text","label":"gggcXDF4391_text","default":"<p>Hyaluronic Acid</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8AaIIewzH_text","label":"gg8AaIIewzH_text","default":"<p>Holds 1,000× its weight in water, inside your skin, not on top.</p>"}],
